msgid "你更新任意一篇文章或页面时，除了那一篇本身，还会把这里列出的地址缓存一并清掉。适合首页、列表页、栏目页，避免新文章发出去了列表还是旧的。填写：每行一条路径，可粘贴完整网址（域名会自动去掉）。整栏都清可写 /blog/(.*) 。不确定就留空。"
msgstr "When you update any post or page, ZapRocket also purges the listed URLs from cache. Use this for the home, lists, and archives so a new post does not leave stale listings. One path per line; you may paste a full URL (the domain is stripped). To purge a whole section, use /blog/(.*). Leave empty if you are unsure."

