msgid "这个前缀会加在桶内文件路径最前面，用来区分「这张图属于哪个网站」。多个网站共用同一个存储桶时，如果都用默认的 wp-content/uploads，路径会撞在一起（都是 wp-content/uploads/2026/10/xxx.jpg），后传的可能盖掉先传的。每个站点请填不同前缀，例如本站填 site2_uploads，桶内就是 site2_uploads/2026/10/xxx.jpg，另一个站填 site1_uploads。只填目录名，不要带域名，不要以斜杠开头或结尾。不填时默认 wp-content/uploads，和 WordPress 媒体库目录一致。原图和缩略图都会带上；从媒体库删除附件时，也会按带前缀的路径删除云上文件。不要填写 ../。"
msgstr "This prefix is prepended to object keys so you can tell which site an image belongs to. If several sites share one bucket and all use the default wp-content/uploads, paths collide (all wp-content/uploads/2026/10/xxx.jpg) and a later upload can overwrite an earlier one. Give each site a different prefix, for example site2_uploads on this site (objects become site2_uploads/2026/10/xxx.jpg) and site1_uploads on another. Enter a directory name only, with no domain and no leading or trailing slash. If left empty, wp-content/uploads is used, matching the WordPress media directory. Originals and thumbnails both get the prefix; deleting an attachment from the media library also deletes the prefixed cloud object. Do not enter ../."

msgid "这是给 Windows Live Writer 用的。现在几乎没人用那个软件写博客，可以去掉。"
msgstr "This is for Windows Live Writer. Almost nobody uses that software to blog now, so it can be removed."

msgid "这是给很老的 jQuery 写法做兼容的，会多占一点加载。多数新主题可以去掉。只改前台，后台编辑器不动。去掉后前台脚本报错，再把本项关掉。"
msgstr "This keeps compatibility with very old jQuery code and adds a little load. Most modern themes can drop it. Front end only; the admin editor is unchanged. If front-end scripts error after removal, turn this option off."

msgid "这是高风险功能：会把历史媒体上传到对象存储，并改写所选内容类型正文里的图片地址。关闭本页不会中止后台队列。回滚只还原已备份的正文链接，不会删除云上文件，也不会清除附件的云标记。默认不删除本地文件。"
msgstr "This is high risk: historical media is uploaded to object storage, and image URLs in the selected content types are rewritten. Closing this page does not stop the background queue. Rollback restores only backed-up content URLs. It does not delete cloud files or clear attachment cloud flags. Local files are not deleted by default."

msgid "这里做不改存储配置的快捷操作。数据库原链接替换只改文章正文和自定义字段里已经写死的地址，不会上传文件。失败记录是上传没成功的附件，可重试或忽略。首次替换请先备份数据库。密钥、桶和域名请到「存储设置」里改。"
msgstr "Quick actions that do not change storage settings. Database URL replace only updates hard-coded URLs in post content and custom fields; it does not upload files. Failed records are attachments that did not upload; you can retry or dismiss. Back up the database before the first replace. Change keys, bucket, and domain under Storage settings."

msgid "这里管「留多少、隔多久自动清」。真正动手删数据请去「垃圾清理」。未勾选整理数据表时，定时任务不会去整理表。"
msgstr "This screen sets how much to keep and how often to clean automatically. Actual deletion is under Cleanup. Tables are not optimized unless that item is selected."

msgid "这里记插件运行与错误，包括数据库扫描、手动清理和定时清理。对象存储「快捷操作」里的失败记录仍保留。前台缓存命中不会写入。"
msgstr "This records plugin runs and errors, including database scans, manual cleanup, and scheduled cleanup. Failed-upload records on object-storage Quick actions stay there. Front-end cache hits are not written."

